Z||000002||DXR_DAD||02-25-2001||04:09 AM||||This is just my thoughts!!!<P>Lets not make this a trend here on the PFF<BR>and I'm sure most members feel the same?<BR>Steve aka DaRkLoRD is going through the same thing and I have heard of others.<P>This needs to stop!! I think that we need to name names. Let us all know who these people are, they may be the same person?<P>It gives the forum a bad name and with all the new members it's just not a good thing<BR>I have had dealing with some of the member here and they have all been good. Those that have had dealings with me I'm sure they were <BR>good ones? I try to treat people the way I would like to be treated and that is the best way to do business.<BR>We talk about being a family, a online club, friends, but you can bet that I would not let someone cheat, beat, mistreat, dog out anyone in my family and I would tell them about any bad dealings with anyone that I have done business with! Anyone the uses Ebay knows to look at the feedback.<BR>I thank that Fierodave says: If you have 0 feedback or negative feedback, you must contact him before bidding. It's just a way to play it safe and cover yourself.<P>If you have a bad deal on Ebay would you leave negative feedback for the seller?? <P>Just .02<BR>DXR_DAD<p>[This message has been edited by DXR_DAD (edited 02-25-2001).]||||reg||8
